    "wacc_rationale": "USD flows, USD rate. Risk-free ~4.3% (10y UST), ERP 5.0%, beta ~1.05 -> cost of equity ~9.5%; pre-tax cost of debt ~4.9% (after-tax ~3.8%) at ~23% debt / 77% equity on market values -> ~8.2%. Rounded up to 8.5%. Same WACC in every scenario: cyclicality (auto OEM, Europe) is charged in the bear flows, not the discount rate.",
