    "notes": "MODEL: owner-FCF component DCF (dcf-methods routing: US operating industrial, moderately cyclical; owner-fcf.md + adaptations for NCI, leases and risk-charged-once). First valuation of this ticker. NET DEBT at 2026-06-30 (Q2 2026 10-Q, filed 2026-07-29): debt $6,886M (current $691M incl. $4M short-term borrowings + long-term $6,195M) less cash $1,520M and short-term investments $74M = $5,292M. INTEREST INCOME not stripped: PPG is net-debt, and the component build is unlevered (EBIT-based), so interest income never enters the projected flows. BASE YEAR NORMALIZATION: FY2025 is used as FY0 because it is clean continuing operations: the FY2024 one-offs ($285M loss on the US/Canada architectural sale, $146M Russia impairment, $233M restructuring) are non-cash or discontinued and do not enter the component build; FY2024 and earlier revenue includes or is restated around divestitures (FY2021 and earlier rows are pre-restatement and still contain US/Canada architectural and silicas). FY2025 reported EBITDA reconstructed from XBRL: pretax $2,045M + interest expense $241M - interest income $153M + depreciation $403M + amortization $125M = $2,661M (16.8% margin, post-SBC). Pre-SBC that is ~17.1%; adding back ~$90M of adjusted-EPS exclusions other than amortization gives ~17.6%. FY2026 base starts at 17.3% because H1 2026 reported EBITDA margin was ~16.7% (vs 17.6% H1 2025) despite +6.9% sales, so the cost program has not yet shown up in reported margins. FY2026 revenue +5.5%: H1 2026 $8,425M (+6.9% incl. ~3pp FX) and H2 assumed +4%. CAPEX was elevated at 4.5-4.9% of revenue in FY2024-25 (aerospace/Asia capacity) vs 2.5-3.2% FY2015-23; H1 2026 capex $309M; path tapers to 3.2% by FY2030. WORKING CAPITAL: manufacturer with receivables + inventory > payables, so growth consumes cash (wc_capture -12%). CASH TAX 23% of EBIT (FY2025 taxes paid $438M = 21.4% of pretax; provision 22.4%). EQUITY BRIDGE: NCI at book and ~$100M estimated remaining cash cost of the $175M-savings restructuring program. Pension funded status not modelled (no material deficit disclosed in the XBRL feed); flag for a future refresh.",
